  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic and brown onion.\n• Roughly chop baby broccoli.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-d388b000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add plant-based mince and onion and cook, breaking up with a spoon, until golden, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add zucchini and baby broccoli and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and risotto-style rice, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add chicken stock and the water. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-2fc9d010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is 'al dente', 24-28 minutes.\n• TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-e37e6b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the risotto is cooking, wipe out the frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients) and cook, stirring, until golden brown, 3 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a small bowl and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-1d7e9530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from the oven and stir through basil pesto and Parmesan cheese.\n• Stir through a splash of water to loosen the risotto if needed. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-ff27e440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based mince and zucchini risotto between bowls.\n• Top with garlic pangrattato to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a15917498f8bf2dae3/step-37d74a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
